Package: web888-websdr
Architecture: armhf
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, adduser, udev, iptables, miniupnpc, netcat-openbsd, sudo
Description: WebSDR server for Web-888 (RX-888) SDR - Debian build
 From-source build of the official RaspSDR/Web-888 WebSDR server,
 patched for Debian: XDG-state layout, systemd-managed service with
 minimal privileges, notify-only server updates (FPGA bitstream
 auto-update only), and no SD-card remount operations.
 Ships /etc/sudoers.d/web888 + root-owned helper scripts for the
 privileged actions the admin UI needs (network drop-in install,
 reboot/halt/poweroff); openssh-server stays an image-level package.
